[00:00.00] 作曲 : Elisabeth Troy Antwi/Grace Chatto/Jack Patterson/Yukara Weekes
[00:01.00] 制作人 : Jack Patterson
[00:02.00] 作词 : Elisabeth Troy Antwi/Grace Chatto/Jack Patterson/Yukara Weekes
[00:14.14]Oh……Ah……
[00:14.14]噢……啊……
[00:22.13]You got me spinning spinning spinning
[00:22.13]你让我天旋地转 不停旋转
[00:27.20]You came in deep, I'm hijacked, it's a holdup
[00:27.20]你深入我心 我已被劫持 这是一场抢劫
[00:31.06]I'm under it, send me spinning every time we touch
[00:31.06]我深陷其中 每次触碰都让我眩晕
[00:34.11]My head is done in,  I think and think about you much
[00:34.11]我的头脑混乱 对你朝思暮想
[00:41.14]I've never been the type of girl to dream about
[00:41.14]我从来不是那种爱幻想的女孩
[00:45.00]Sugary things and I don't believe in fairytales
[00:45.00]不相信甜蜜童话 也不信糖衣谎言
[00:48.05]But now to me it's like your love is oxygen
[00:48.05]但此刻你的爱就像我的氧气
[00:54.21]So hear me when I say this, boy I tell you true, I ain't easy
[00:54.21]听我说 男孩 我坦白告诉你 我可不好对付
[01:01.11]There's something about you just make me so crazy
[01:01.11]但你身上有种魔力让我如此疯狂
[01:09.03]I can't breath, you set my heart on fire
[01:09.03]无法呼吸 你让我的心熊熊燃烧
[01:15.06]Every single thing you do does set my heart on fire
[01:15.06]你的一举一动都点燃我的心火
[01:21.10]I struggle to breath, I can't breath, you set my heart on fire
[01:21.10]艰难喘息 无法呼吸 你让我的心熊熊燃烧
[01:28.15]Start it again, I can't breath, you set my heart on fire
[01:28.15]重来一次 无法呼吸 你让我的心熊熊燃烧
[01:39.20]All about the feeling, it's off, and I'm a hedonist
[01:39.20]全凭感觉 我是个享乐主义者
[01:43.08]It's a chemistry, I'm so jacked up on your medicine
[01:43.08]这是化学反应 我沉溺于你的良药
[01:46.19]This thing is next, I'm so in, not taking any chance, no……
[01:46.19]这次不同 我全心投入 绝不放手 不……
[01:53.10]Boy you got me freaking, I never thought I'd be like this
[01:53.10]男孩你让我失控 从未想过会这样
[01:56.60]When you go I'm tweaking, I'm pining for another fix
[01:56.60]你离开时我崩溃 渴求下一次治愈
[02:00.07]Told you before, your love is my oxygen, Oh……
[02:00.07]早告诉过你 你的爱是我的氧气 噢……
